      "statement": "MHFC reported Q2 2026 net income of $6.54 billion and diluted EPS of $4.48 on net revenue of $22.48 billion; net income was down 0.3% sequentially and up 6.9% year-on-year, while EPS grew faster (+9.5% YoY) because average diluted shares fell about 2.0% to 1,402 million.",
