      "id": "claim_9f2787bbe969478ebb6465127ca19ab1",
      "statement": "The 2026 NII outlook was raised to about $50.5 billion from about $50.2 billion because of stronger deposit balances; the bridge from 2025 is Card growth +$1.1bn, securities reinvestment +$0.6bn, deposit growth +$0.5bn, lower policy rates on deposit margins -$1.0bn, migration to higher-yielding deposit products -$0.4bn, plus about $1.1bn of other balance sheet effects. Adjusted expense is guided to about $49.5bn and the Card NCO rate to about 3.6%, on the June 30, 2026 forward curve.",
